  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Senegal - Colloque sur les Coll&#xe8;ges Communautaires &#xe0; Dakar</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senegal - Colloquium on Community Colleges in Dakar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project was approved in August 2010.  The objective is to increase the knowledge of the participating countries&#x2019; ministries on training methodologies in francophone African higher education institutions, in collaboration with Canadian education institutions. The expected impact is to increase the capacity of the beneficiaries to tap into the various choices that exist for technical and professional education which links to better human resources for economic development. The project is on schedule and is expected to end by April 2011. 
Approved: CAD 150,000 (full disbursement expected in the first quarter of 2011)</narrative>
  </description>
